Cloakroom

A small brass hook is on the wall.

There is a cloak here.

> take the cloak
You wear the cloak.

> east
Foyer of the Opera House

Stella is a brown corgi. She is in a deep sleep.

Bentley is a gray striped cat. He is in a deep sleep.

There is an apple, a painting, a table, a cube, and grime here.
On the table are grapes and a card.

> south
Foyer Bar
The bar, much rougher than you'd have guessed after the opulence of the foyer to the north, is completely empty.

There seems to be some sort of message scrawled in the sawdust on the floor.

> examine message
You grope around clumsily in the dark. Better be careful.

> north
Foyer of the Opera House

Stella is a brown corgi. She is in a deep sleep.

Bentley is a gray striped cat. He is in a deep sleep.

There is an apple, a painting, a table, a cube, and grime here.
On the table are grapes and a card.

> drop cloak
